  "name": "Nether Portal opens a portal and its Shadow Bolts call three demons, then a greater one (#9806, #7326)",
  "contract": [
    "Nether Portal 290441: 'Tear open a portal to the Twisting Nether for $290443d. Casting Shadow Bolt, Incinerate or",
    "Soul Fire summons a demon to fight for you. Summoning 3 demons causes a stronger one to be summoned which sends",
    "the previous ones back to the nether.' The cast summons portal 840095 and applies the 20 s buff 290443.",
    "Each Shadow Bolt under the buff summons a guardian: casts 1-3 from Darkhound/Satyr/Void Terror/Wrathguard, each with",
    "tier 1 (290447: +100% attack power, +100% damage); cast 4 unsummons them and summons a Dreadlord or Shivarra with",
    "tier 2 (290448: +100% attack power, +250% damage); later casts summon nothing. Every demon leaves 0.5 s after the",
    "buff ends, and the portal with it. Picks are random, so demons are counted by their tier aura among the Hero's",
    "controlled units.",
    "Demons are scaled to the owner's level from creature_classlevelstats (unit_class 1, expansion 0) as",
    "Demons are scaled to the owner's level from creature_classlevelstats (unit_class 1, expansion 0) as",
    "Creature::SelectLevel does: weapon damage_base to 1.5x, attack power attackpower, attack time 2000. The tier auras'",
    "aura 99 is SPELL_AURA_MOD_ATTACK_POWER, a flat +100 attack power, and aura 79 (+100% / +250% damage done) sits in",
    "the main-hand TOTAL_PCT, so the damage fields already include it: (weapon + (AP + 100) / 14) * 2.0 * (1 + pct).",
    "Level 60 (33.9625, AP 252): tier 1 236.42-304.35, tier 2 413.74-532.61. Level 35 (15.8617, AP 118): tier 1 125.73-157.46, tier 2 220.03-275.55."
  ],
